    "title": "Seymour Duncan: Music Man passive, 2 volumes, 1 tone",
    "creator": "Pickup Lab; reference: Seymour Duncan",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.seymourduncan.com/images/wiring-diagrams/MM_Passive_2V_1T.pdf",
    "permission": "Seymour Duncan encourages sharing these wiring diagrams freely; commercial use requires written permission. LIMITATIONS: Black/red map to front/rear coil starts; shared green/white/bare map to finishes and shield. Two volumes exceed the analyzer's master-volume limit, so no estimate. Bridge ground reaches master-tone casing; no bridge terminal. The 0.05 cap maps to 47 nF. Pots use logical lugs and linear—not physical/audio-taper—controls."
